@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Player
participant "Map Editor" as System

activate Player

    Player -> System : I want to upgrade a station
    deactivate Player
    activate System

    System -> Player : Requests Inputs (which station and what building is to be placed)
    deactivate System
    activate Player

    Player -> System : Enters requested data
    deactivate Player
    activate System

    System -> Player : Output success message, updates the map and the station's attributes

@enduml